| دارایی legacy | مسیر | فاز ۴ |
|---------------|------|-------|
| Host label parse | [`legacy/packages/tenant-host`](../legacy/packages/tenant-host/src/parse-workspace-tenant-label.ts) | `@app-tour/tenant-kernel` (pure TS) |
| API tenant resolver | [`legacy/apps/api/src/common/tenant/tenant-resolver.middleware.ts`](../legacy/apps/api/src/common/tenant/tenant-resolver.middleware.ts) | الگو — Nest/Node adapter در `apps/api` |
| RLS session bind | [`legacy/apps/api/src/database/tenant-session-binding.service.ts`](../legacy/apps/api/src/database/tenant-session-binding.service.ts) | `withTenantTransaction` + Prisma `$executeRaw` |
| RLS SQL constants | [`legacy/apps/api/src/database/rls-tenant-session.ts`](../legacy/apps/api/src/database/rls-tenant-session.ts) | MAP name: `app.current_tenant_id` |
| Subdomain e2e | [`legacy/apps/api/test/e2e/subdomain-multi-tenant.e2e-spec.ts`](../legacy/apps/api/test/e2e/subdomain-multi-tenant.e2e-spec.ts) | Testcontainers در app-tour |
| Tenant theme CSS | [`legacy/apps/web/lib/tenant/build-tenant-theme-style.ts`](../legacy/apps/web/lib/tenant/build-tenant-theme-style.ts) | `@app-tour/theme-react` — wire API در 4.4 |
| Web tenant provider | [`legacy/apps/web/lib/tenant/tenant-provider.tsx`](../legacy/apps/web/lib/tenant/tenant-provider.tsx) | RSC props → `TenantThemeProvider` |
| Events | [`legacy/apps/api/src/common/events/`](../legacy/apps/api/src/common/events/) | **`@app-tour/platform-events`** (ترجیح MAP §6) · hook در `CanonicalTourService` |
| Docker stack | [`legacy/infra/docker-compose.yml`](../legacy/infra/docker-compose.yml) | [`infra/docker-compose.yml`](../infra/docker-compose.yml) در root |

### 3.2 anti-port

| anti-pattern | چرا ممنوع |
|--------------|-----------|
| Copy کل Nest `TenantModule` به `platform-core` | core headless |
| Denali در `tenant-kernel` | فاز ۶ |
| RLS به‌تنهایی بدون CASL | leakage از raw SQL / service account |
| `tenantId` از query/header بدون verify | RF-F09 class |
| grep-only phase-4 closure | MAP §12.1 |

