## 5. معماری tenant kernel + defense-in-depth

### 5.1 جریان request

```text
Request (Host + Authorization)
        │
        ▼
packages/tenant-kernel     ← parse host · validate label · TenantRoute (design)
        │
        ├── apps/api — ingress در `apps/api/src/tenant-kernel/` (JWT · dev bearer gated · headers)
        │     → `createApiAbility` + `accessibleByTourWhere` ([`phase-3-design-system.md` §10](phase-3-design-system.md))
        │     → Prisma + `SET_LOCAL_RLS_TENANT_SQL` ([`tenant-kernel` RLS constants](packages/tenant-kernel/src/rls/session.ts))
        │
        └── apps/web (RSC) — [`phase-3-design-system.md` §11](phase-3-design-system.md)
              → `resolveBootstrapAppSession()` per request ([`layout.tsx`](../apps/web/app/layout.tsx))
              → `ThemeProviderChain`: Platform → Tenant → Workspace ([`phase-2-design-system.md` §5.2](phase-2-design-system.md#52-زنجیره-provider-هدف--فاز-۲-harness،-فاز-۳-production))
              → `WorkspaceThemeProvider` + CASL **قبل** ingress (P3-E-CASL-01 — unchanged)
        │
        ▼
Postgres RLS policies      ← safety net (layer 2)
```

### 5.2 تفکیک theme (همان فاز ۲ — فاز ۴ فقط Tenant را operational می‌کند)

| لایه | قرارداد | مالک | فاز |
|------|---------|------|-----|
| Platform | `--color-*` semantic | `@app-tour/design-tokens` | ۲ ✅ |
| Tenant | `TenantThemeConfig` | DB / tenant settings · validate در SDK | ۲ types ✅ · **۴ provider + API** |
| Workspace | `--ws-*` · ingress T-1–T-7 | `WorkspacePlugin.theme` | ۲–۳ ✅ |

**ترتیب Provider (ثابت — [`phase-2-design-system.md` §5.2](phase-2-design-system.md)):**

```text
PlatformThemeProvider
  └ TenantThemeProvider     ← فاز ۴: config از API، نه `{}` mock
       └ WorkspaceThemeProvider  ← starter تا فاز ۶؛ CASL قبل ingress (فاز ۳)
```

**تفاوت با workspace theme:** tenant = یک **سازمان** (لوگو/accent) · workspace = **مدل کسب‌وکار** (starter/Denali) — [`phase-2-design-system.md` §8.3](phase-2-design-system.md#83-تفکیک-از-tenant-فاز-۴).

### 5.3 `TenantConnectionRouter` (stub)

```typescript
// packages/tenant-kernel — design for phase 7
export interface TenantRoute {
  readonly tenantId: string;
  readonly tier: "pool" | "silo";
  readonly databaseUrl: string;
}
```

