## 8. زیرفاز 4.1 — `packages/tenant-kernel`

### 8.1 هدف

استخراج منطق generic tenant از `apps/api/src/tenant-kernel` به پکیج مستقل — **بدون** Nest · **بدون** Prisma در پکیج (فقط types/helpers).

### 8.2 ساختار پکیج

```text
packages/tenant-kernel/
  src/
    host/           ← port legacy tenant-host
    rls/            ← SET LOCAL helpers · policy name constants
    route.ts        ← TenantRoute interface
    index.ts
  test/
    phase-4.contract.spec.ts
    host-parse.spec.ts
```

### 8.3 API surface (واقعی — [`packages/tenant-kernel/src/index.ts`](../packages/tenant-kernel/src/index.ts))

| Export | نقش |
|--------|-----|
| `parseWorkspaceTenantLabelFromHost` | subdomain → label outcome (reserved · invalid · apex) |
| `resolveWorkspaceSlugFromNormalizedHost` | label string یا null |
| `RLS_TENANT_SETTING` · `SET_LOCAL_RLS_TENANT_SQL` | MAP §7.1 session variable |
| `TenantRoute` · `TenantTier` | hybrid stub — implement فاز ۷ |

**باقی می‌ماند در `apps/api/src/tenant-kernel/` تا استخراج کامل:** `resolveTenantContextFromRequest` · JWT · `parse-dev-bearer` · `auth-env` — ingress وابسته به HTTP ([§8.4](#84-import-boundary)).

### 8.4 Import boundary

```text
tenant-kernel  → workspace-sdk (types only, optional)
tenant-kernel  ↛ platform-core · ↛ design-tokens · ↛ workspaces/*
apps/api       → tenant-kernel, workspace-sdk, platform-core
apps/web       → tenant-kernel (types/host parse), theme-react, workspace-sdk
platform-core  ↛ tenant-kernel
```

### 8.5 Exit criteria 4.1

- [ ] `@app-tour/tenant-kernel` build + test
- [ ] `phase-4.contract.spec.ts` — host adversarial (reserved, apex, invalid)
- [ ] `apps/api` re-export/wire ingress از پکیج (thin adapter)
- [ ] Subdomain design doc در §8 (جدول reserved labels)

---

## 9. زیرفاز 4.2 — Postgres + Redis + RLS + Prisma

### 9.1 Infra

[`infra/docker-compose.yml`](../infra/docker-compose.yml):

| سرویس | پورت host | نقش |
|---------|-----------|-----|
| postgres | 5433→5432 | RLS + Prisma |
| redis | 6379 | idempotency scaffold (4.5) |

### 9.2 Schema (حداقل)

```sql
-- tenants: id, subdomain (unique), workspace_type, theme JSONB
-- tours: id, tenant_id NOT NULL, canonical JSONB, ...
-- RLS: ENABLE + FORCE on tours; policy USING (tenant_id = current_setting('app.current_tenant_id', true)::uuid)
```

**Prisma:** [`apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma`](../apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma) — مرجع schema.

**CASL + DB (هم‌راستا فاز ۳):** فاز ۳ [`accessibleByTourWhere`](../apps/api/src/casl/api-ability.ts) روی in-memory؛ فاز ۴ همان ability را روی **Prisma** با [`@casl/prisma`](../apps/api/docs/prisma-accessible-by.md) — نه جایگزین rules در `workspace-sdk`.

### 9.3 `withTenantTransaction`

اولین statement در transaction:

```sql
SELECT set_config('app.current_tenant_id', $1::text, true);
```

سپس Prisma queries — mirror legacy `TenantSessionBindingService` بدون TypeORM.

### 9.4 جایگزینی in-memory

| قبل | بعد |
|-----|-----|
| `InMemoryTourRepository` | `PrismaTourRepository` وقتی `DATABASE_URL` set |
| `main.ts` global array | env `TOUR_STORAGE=postgres` |

In-memory می‌ماند برای unit tests بدون Docker — **نه** default production.

### 9.5 Exit criteria 4.2

- [ ] Migration + seed دو tenant
- [ ] Testcontainers (یا tagged integration): tenant A ≠ B
- [ ] Restart survival: tour persists after API restart
- [ ] `P4-E-RLS-01` · `P4-E-DATA-01` green

---

## 10. زیرفاز 4.3 — provision + دو tenant

### 10.1 Provision

- Seed: `tenant-a`, `tenant-b` · `workspace_type: starter` (هم‌نام [`starterWorkspacePlugin`](../packages/workspaces/starter))
- Dev route (gated): `POST /internal/tenants/provision` — `NODE_ENV=development` only
- **بعد از 4.3 (اختیاری):** resolve `pluginId` از header/registry در validation — تکمیل RF-F03 ([`audit-red-flags-phase-3.md`](../audit-red-flags-phase-3.md))؛ فاز ۳ هنوز `starter` hard-coded در [`canonical-validation.ts`](../apps/api/src/tours/canonical-validation.ts)

### 10.2 E2E proof

```bash
# Host: tenant-a.localhost:3001
curl -H "Host: tenant-a.localhost" … POST /tours
# tenant-b cannot read tenant-a tour id
```

### 10.3 Exit criteria 4.3

- [ ] MAP 4.3 «دو tenant جدا» — automated test
- [ ] default `workspace_type` on provision

---

## 11. زیرفاز 4.4 — `TenantThemeProvider` production

### 11.1 API

`GET /api/v2/tenant-config` (یا `/tenant/theme`) — kernel-scoped · returns `TenantThemeConfig`

### 11.2 Web

```text
RootLayout (RSC)
  → resolve host → tenantId
  → fetch tenant-config (server-only)
  → AppProviders → TenantThemeProvider theme={…} data-tenant-id={tenantId}
```

CASL: قبل از اعمال tenant CSS — همان الگوی فاز ۳ برای `WorkspaceTheme` ([`ThemeProviderChain`](../packages/theme-react) + `authz` از [`workspace-sdk`](../packages/workspace-sdk/src/auth/))؛ subject `Tenant` در `ability.ts` در PR جدا اگر هنوز نیست.

### 11.3 Exit criteria 4.4

- [ ] tenant A `primaryColor` ≠ tenant B در e2e
- [ ] بدون `NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_TENANT_ID` as sole prod source

---

## 12. زیرفاز 4.5 — in-process event bus

### 12.1 پکیج

`@app-tour/platform-events`:

```typescript
publishDomainEvent({ tenantId, type, payload }): void
subscribe(type, handler): void
```

**قوانین:** cross-tenant dispatch → throw · handler idempotent (`eventId` dedupe در ۴ minimal).

### 12.2 Hook

`CanonicalTourService` پس از persist موفق → `TourCreated`.

### 12.3 Exit criteria 4.5

- [ ] unit: subscriber receives event with correct `tenantId`
- [ ] integration: publish after `POST /tours` (postgres path)

