## 14. PHASE 4 ENFORCEMENT (الزام CI)

> هر PR `Phase: 4.x` **باید** شناسه `P4-E-*` در checklist داشته باشد.

### 14.1 Verification table (Doc-Claim ↔ CI 1:1)

| Claim | Enforcement ID | Mechanism | FAIL if |
|-------|----------------|-----------|---------|
| No API request without tenant context | `P4-E-TENANT-01` | `apps/api/test/tenant-security.spec.ts` | 200 without headers/JWT |
| Dev bearer dead in prod | `P4-E-AUTH-01` | `tenant-kernel.spec.ts` + security spec | bearer accepted when flag off |
| RLS blocks cross-tenant read | `P4-E-RLS-01` | `test/rls-isolation.integration.spec.ts` | B reads A row |
| `set_config` transactional | `P4-E-RLS-02` | unit mock pool reuse | session leak test fails |
| Postgres SoT | `P4-E-DATA-01` | restart + find tour | in-memory only in prod path |
| Host parse reserved | `P4-E-HOST-01` | `phase-4.contract.spec.ts` | `api.localhost` → tenant |
| Event carries tenantId | `P4-E-EVT-01` | platform-events spec | missing tenant on envelope |
| Write path O(1) tenant scope | `P4-E-SCALE-01` | repository spec + doc Big-O | full table scan documented |
| Red-flag prerequisite | `P4-E-RF-40` | status report + guard | R0–R3 open |
| Phase 3 regression | `P4-E-REG-03` | `phase-3:gate` in phase-4:gate | phase-3 red |

**grep-only:** supplementary ([MAP §20](MIGRATION-MAP.md#۲۰-guardrails-ci)) — never sole closure proof.

### 14.2 `phase-4:guard` checks (هدف)

| # | Check |
|---|--------|
| 1 | `@app-tour/tenant-kernel` build + test ≥ baseline |
| 2 | `@app-tour/platform-events` test |
| 3 | `phase-4.contract.spec.ts` PASS |
| 4 | `P4-E-RF-40` report exists |
| 5 | `rg -i denali packages/tenant-kernel` → 0 |
| 6 | depcruise tenant-kernel boundary |
| 7 | Write `reports/phase-4-gate-*.json` |

