### 16.1 §14.4 Forensic Truth vs Marketing

> **Mandatory** per [MAP §14.4](MIGRATION-MAP.md#۱۴۴-self-referencing-audit-mandatory-phase-docs).

| Claim | Reality | Status |
|-------|---------|--------|
| «Multi-tenant enterprise» | Until 4.2, tours may be in-memory | **Aspirational** until `P4-E-DATA-01` |
| «Subdomain routing» | Host parse in 4.1; DB lookup in 4.2 | **Partial** until provision |
| «Phase 3 Zero-Debt» | **Gate** فاز ۳ = visual/app/CASL scaffold · **نه** ادعای tenant production | **Enforced** honesty — 4.0 جدا |
| `ThemeProviderChain` order | فاز ۲/۳ ثابت | Tenant layer operational in 4.4 — **نه** جابجایی با Workspace |
| `@casl/prisma` در runtime | فاز ۳: reference test + in-memory | **۴.2** Postgres path |
| JWT production auth | Slot in API; full OTP/session = 4.4+ | **Aspirational** if stub only |
| Hybrid silo `TenantRoute` | Interface only in 4.1 | **Aspirational** until phase 7 |
| Transactional outbox | In-process bus only in 4.5 | **Deferred** phase 5 |
| Playwright subdomain | Soft / optional | **Backlog** |

